---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-12 pb-20 md:pt-18 md:pb-24 border-b border-canvas-border">
  <!-- Subtle technical grid background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#1b233818_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#1b233818_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:3rem_3rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Top System Badge -->
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-tech border border-canvas-border bg-canvas-surface/80 text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs backdrop-blur-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-telemetry animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>feliperiquel.me // kernel ready</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline (Tested & Frozen) -->
    <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto tracking-tight leading-[1.12] mb-6">
      Ideo soluciones sólidas hasta para el problema <span class="text-telemetry underline decoration-telemetry/40 underline-offset-8">más mundano</span>.
    </h1>

    <!-- Supporting Sentence (Tested & Frozen) -->
    <p class="font-sans text-slate-300 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
      En este sitio encontrarás mis proyectos destacados y mi laboratorio de pruebas. Soy <a href="#sobre-mi" class="font-semibold text-white hover:text-telemetry transition-colors duration-140 focus-visible:rounded-tech-sm inline-block group" title="Conocer más sobre mí">feliperiquel<span class="text-telemetry group-hover:underline">.me</span></a>: desarrollador detallista, con foco ingenieril y recién entrando al mercado.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3.5 max-w-md mx-auto mb-14">
      <a
        href="/lab"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-tech font-mono text-xs font-bold text-telemetry-dark bg-telemetry hover:bg-telemetry-hover shadow-glow-cyan transition-all duration-140 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <span>Explorar el Laboratorio</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#proyectos"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-tech font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 bg-canvas-surface hover:bg-canvas-raised border border-canvas-border hover:border-slate-600 transition-all duration-140 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <span>Ver proyectos & repositorios</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Engineering Capability Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-tech bg-canvas-surface/60 border border-canvas-border">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-domain-audio mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-domain-audio"></span>
          Audio & DSP
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">Filtros biquad, EQ paramétrico de 8 bandas y visualización FFT con Web Audio API.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-tech bg-canvas-surface/60 border border-canvas-border">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-telemetry mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-telemetry"></span>
          Homelab & Bots
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">Bots en Discord y WhatsApp orquestados con Docker, colas multimedia y el stack *arr.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-tech bg-canvas-surface/60 border border-canvas-border">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-domain-ai mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-domain-ai"></span>
          Fullstack & Web
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">Astro, TypeScript, Python, Docker y arquitecturas con 100/100 en Core Web Vitals.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-tech bg-canvas-surface/60 border border-canvas-border">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-domain-algo mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-domain-algo"></span>
          Algoritmia & ML
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-normal">Metaheurísticas continuas evaluadas en IEEE CEC y modelos de sincronización con IA.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
